# Generated shinylive bundle (~180 MB: the R WebAssembly runtime plus ~90
# packages). Rebuild it with apps/exploreMetaTax/build.R rather than committing
# it -- git keeps every version of a binary blob forever. Remove this line if
# you want to publish the bundle straight from the repo, e.g. via GitHub Pages.
apps/*/site/
